{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y个别短段里的感受句偏长，瞬间扫词的利落感略不如X少数短词组。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y把“发生了什么”和“听起来是什么感觉”分层，又用【】把每段转折钉出来，扫屏时更容易先抓主线，再按余裕接住细节；“到时出现”也避免了一次把所有感受堆在眼前。更重要的是，Y的感受大多贴着具体一句话和具体时刻出现，所以不仅知道他在犹豫、想念或害怕，还比较容易明白这些情绪为什么此刻冒出来；十三段之间也因此更像同一条逐步变化的心理线，而不是主线旁边另挂一堆形容词。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "28de68f4-2159-459e-a933-8022790058c4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T032258727711Z", "elapsed_seconds": 8.234, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:23:06.978379+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "324d4f389a639f5cecea33950f96045a1ea0270e50d82d7d08e1da25d778d979", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screen